---* `blocking_merge_queue` - Blocking Merge Queue
---* `novel_burst` - Novel Burst
---* `potentially_resolved` - Potentially Resolved
---* `flaky` - Flaky
---* `pr_only` - PR Only
---@alias posthog.engineering_analytics.BrokenTestStateEnum "breaking_master"|"blocking_merge_queue"|"novel_burst"|"potentially_resolved"|"flaky"|"pr_only"

