---@field run_scope? posthog.engineering_analytics.EngineeringAnalyticsJobAggregatesRequestRunScope|string Which group of runs to report on: 'all' (default) is every run; 'default_branch' is runs on master or main; 'pull_request' is runs on PR branches, excluding default-branch and merge-queue runs; 'merge_queue' is the gate runs the merge queue fired before a merge landed. Fork PRs carry no PR attribution (a GitHub limitation), so they appear only under 'all'. Any other value is a 400.
---@field source_id? string Connected GitHub data warehouse source to read from. Defaults to the oldest connected GitHub source that the `sources` list reports as synced, when the team has more than one.
---@field workflow_name string Workflow name to aggregate jobs for.

---@alias posthog.engineering_analytics.EngineeringAnalyticsJobAggregatesRequestRunScope "all"|"default_branch"|"merge_queue"|"pull_request"

