---@class posthog.engineering_analytics.EngineeringAnalyticsJobLogInsightsRequest
---@field project_id string Project ID of the project you're trying to access. To find the ID of the project, make a call to /api/projects/.
---@field ci_engine? posthog.engineering_analytics.EngineeringAnalyticsJobLogInsightsRequestCiEngine|string CI engine. Required when job_id exists in both engines. Only GitHub Actions job logs are read. * `github_actions` - GitHub Actions * `depot_ci` - Depot CI
