---@field project_id string Project ID of the project you're trying to access. To find the ID of the project, make a call to /api/projects/.
---@field operation posthog.engineering_analytics.QuarantineRequestActionEnum|string What to do: 'quarantine' (add or replace an entry and file a tracking issue), 'extend' (re-stamp an existing entry's expiry, reusing its issue), or 'remove' (delete the entry). All three open a pull request. * `quarantine` - Quarantine * `extend` - Extend * `remove` - Remove
---@field selector string Test selector to act on: an exact test id, a file, a directory, a class prefix, or 'product:<dashed-name>'.
