---@field repo? string|distilled.Null Optional 'owner/name' repository override; defaults to the team's most active repo.
---@field reason? string Why the test is quarantined. Required for quarantine and extend; ignored by remove.
---@field owner? string GitHub team or user handle responsible for the fix, e.g. '@PostHog/team-x'. Required for quarantine and extend.
---@field issue? string Existing tracking issue URL, carried forward on extend and remove. Ignored by quarantine, which files a fresh issue.
