---@field p75_seconds number|distilled.Null 75th percentile of the stage's duration, in seconds. Null when nothing deployed.
---@field p95_seconds number|distilled.Null 95th percentile of the stage's duration, in seconds: the upper whisker when outliers are excluded. Null when nothing deployed.
---@field max_seconds number|distilled.Null Slowest duration for this stage in this bucket, in seconds. Null when nothing deployed.

