---@class posthog.engineering_analytics.ReadyToMergeBucket
---@field bucket_start string Bucket start, aligned to ready_to_merge_series_granularity (top of hour, midnight, or Monday).
---@field p50_seconds number|distilled.Null Median per-PR ready_to_merge_seconds (merged_at minus the last observed ready-for-review transition) over PRs merged in this bucket, bots and drafts excluded. Null when nothing merged with an observed value (a gap, never zero).

---@class posthog.engineering_analytics.ReadyToMergeMedians
---@field merged_pr_count number Pull requests merged in the window, bots and drafts excluded.
---@field ready_to_merge_seconds number|distilled.Null Median seconds from the last ready_for_review to merge. Null when nothing was measured.
---@field p90_ready_to_merge_seconds number|distilled.Null 90th percentile of the ready-to-merge seconds.
---@field ready_to_first_approval_seconds number|distilled.Null Median seconds from ready to the first approval, over the pull requests with an approval. Null when nothing was measured.
---@field first_approval_to_merge_seconds number|distilled.Null Median seconds from the first approval to merge. The two approval medians do not add up to the ready-to-merge median.
---@field before_first_approval_share number|distilled.Null Share (0 to 1) of all ready-to-merge hours spent before the first approval, summed over the pull requests, so long pull requests weigh more.

---@class posthog.engineering_analytics.RepoOverview
---@field cost_series posthog.engineering_analytics.RepoOverviewCostSeriesList CI cost per merged PR across the window, oldest first, zero-filled, bucketed by cost_series_granularity. Empty when the job-level source isn't synced or include_series=false.
---@field time_to_green_series posthog.engineering_analytics.RepoOverviewTimeToGreenSeriesList Median time-to-green (p50 wall clock for a PR push round to settle fully green) per bucket across the window, oldest first, bucketed by time_to_green_series_granularity. Empty buckets carry null; the whole series is empty when include_series=false.
---@field success_rate_series posthog.engineering_analytics.RepoOverviewSuccessRateSeriesList CI pass rate (conclusive runs that succeeded, all branches) per bucket across the window, oldest first, bucketed by success_rate_series_granularity. Skipped, cancelled, neutral, and action_required runs are excluded. Empty buckets carry null; the whole series is empty when include_series=false.
---@field open_to_merge_series posthog.engineering_analytics.RepoOverviewOpenToMergeSeriesList Median time-to-merge (p50 open_to_merge_seconds, bots/drafts excluded) per bucket across the window, oldest first, bucketed by open_to_merge_series_granularity. Empty buckets carry null; the whole series is empty when include_series=false.
---@field delivery_pipeline posthog.engineering_analytics.DeliveryPipeline Where a change's wall-clock time goes on the way to production, over PRs merged in the window with bots and drafts excluded.
---@field ready_to_merge_series posthog.engineering_analytics.RepoOverviewReadyToMergeSeriesList Median cycle time (p50 per-PR ready_to_merge_seconds, bots/drafts excluded) per bucket across the window, oldest first, bucketed by ready_to_merge_series_granularity. Empty buckets carry null; the whole series is empty when the issue-events table isn't synced or include_series=false, so fall back to open_to_merge_series.
---@field revert_share_series posthog.engineering_analytics.RepoOverviewRevertShareSeriesList Reverting merges over all merges (all authors, bots included) per bucket across the window, oldest first, zero-filled, bucketed by revert_share_series_granularity. Empty buckets carry a null share; the whole series is empty when include_series=false.
---@field run_count number Workflow runs started in the window, all branches and workflows.
---@field run_count_prev number Same count over the equal-length window immediately before date_from: the delta baseline.
---@field success_rate number|distilled.Null Fraction of conclusive runs that succeeded (0-1) in the window. Skipped, cancelled, neutral, and action_required runs are excluded. Null if no run reached a verdict.
---@field success_rate_prev number|distilled.Null Conclusive-run success rate over the previous window. Null if no run reached a verdict.
---@field rerun_cycles number Runs in the window that were a 2nd+ attempt (attempt > 1).
---@field rerun_cycles_prev number Re-run cycles over the previous window.
---@field merged_pr_count number PRs merged in the window, all authors and bots included. billable_minutes and estimated_cost_usd cover every run in the window, including default-branch and unmerged PR runs, so dividing them by this count spreads all CI spend over the merges.
---@field merged_pr_count_prev number Merged-PR count over the previous window.
---@field reverting_pr_count number PRs merged in the window whose title names a revert: GitHub's 'Revert "..."' or a conventional-commit 'revert: ...' / 'revert(scope): ...' title. Counts the revert when it merges, not the change it undid, which may have merged in an earlier window. Same population as merged_pr_count.
---@field reverting_pr_count_prev number Reverting-PR count over the previous window.
---@field revert_share number|distilled.Null reverting_pr_count divided by merged_pr_count: the share of merges that undid an earlier merge. The guardrail to watch when review requirements are loosened. Null when nothing merged.
---@field revert_share_prev number|distilled.Null The same share over the previous window. Null when nothing merged.
---@field median_open_to_merge_seconds number|distilled.Null Median merged_at - created_at over PRs merged in the window, bots and drafts excluded. Coarse by design: draft and ready-for-review time are fused. Null when nothing merged.
---@field median_open_to_merge_seconds_prev number|distilled.Null The same median over the previous window. Null when nothing merged.
---@field median_ready_to_merge_seconds number|distilled.Null Median per-PR ready_to_merge_seconds (the true cycle time: merged_at minus the last observed ready-for-review transition) over PRs merged in the window, bots and drafts excluded. Null when the issue-events table isn't synced or no merged PR has an observed value; fall back to median_open_to_merge_seconds and label it open-to-merge.
---@field median_ready_to_merge_seconds_prev number|distilled.Null The same median over the previous window. Null when not observed.
---@field billable_minutes number|distilled.Null Billable (self-hosted) job minutes in the window; null when the job-level source isn't synced.
---@field billable_minutes_prev number|distilled.Null Billable minutes over the previous window; null when the job-level source isn't synced.
---@field estimated_cost_usd number|distilled.Null Estimated CI cost in USD (billable minutes x runner-tier rate); null when the job-level source isn't synced.
---@field estimated_cost_usd_prev number|distilled.Null Estimated cost over the previous window; null when the job-level source isn't synced.
---@field cost_per_merge_usd number|distilled.Null estimated_cost_usd divided by merged_pr_count: the window's CI cost per merged PR. Null when the job-level source isn't synced or nothing merged.
---@field cost_per_merge_usd_prev number|distilled.Null The same ratio over the previous window. Null when the job-level source isn't synced or nothing merged.
---@field merge_queue_billable_minutes number|distilled.Null Slice of billable_minutes spent on merge-queue batch branches (trunk-merge/**); null when the job-level source isn't synced.
---@field merge_queue_billable_minutes_prev number|distilled.Null Merge-queue billable minutes over the previous window; null when the job-level source isn't synced.
---@field depot_ci_billable_minutes number|distilled.Null Slice of billable_minutes from jobs that ran on the Depot CI engine; null when the job-level source isn't synced.
---@field depot_ci_billable_minutes_prev number|distilled.Null Depot CI billable minutes over the previous window; null when the job-level source isn't synced.
---@field merge_queue_merged_pr_count number PRs merged in the window with at least one corroborated merge-queue gate run: the population behind every merge_queue_* landing stat. All authors, bots included.
---@field merge_queue_merged_pr_count_prev number Queue-landed merges over the previous window.
---@field merge_queue_median_first_gate_to_merge_seconds number|distilled.Null Median seconds from a PR's first observed merge-queue gate run starting to the PR merging. Pending time before gate testing starts is not included. Null when no queue-landed merges.
---@field merge_queue_median_first_gate_to_merge_seconds_prev number|distilled.Null The same median over the previous window. Null when no queue-landed merges.
---@field merge_queue_p90_first_gate_to_merge_seconds number|distilled.Null p90 of the same first-gate-run-to-merge measure: the tail, where queue pain concentrates. Null when no queue-landed merges.
---@field merge_queue_p90_first_gate_to_merge_seconds_prev number|distilled.Null The same p90 over the previous window. Null when no queue-landed merges.
---@field merge_queue_p95_first_gate_to_merge_seconds number|distilled.Null p95 of the same first-gate-run-to-merge measure. Null when no queue-landed merges.
---@field merge_queue_p95_first_gate_to_merge_seconds_prev number|distilled.Null The same p95 over the previous window. Null when no queue-landed merges.
---@field merge_queue_p99_first_gate_to_merge_seconds number|distilled.Null p99 of the same first-gate-run-to-merge measure. Null when no queue-landed merges.
---@field merge_queue_p99_first_gate_to_merge_seconds_prev number|distilled.Null The same p99 over the previous window. Null when no queue-landed merges.
---@field merge_queue_avg_attempts_per_merge number|distilled.Null Mean distinct gate attempts (distinct gate branches, flake-bisection branches collapsed) per queue-landed merge. Null when no queue-landed merges.
---@field merge_queue_avg_attempts_per_merge_prev number|distilled.Null The same mean over the previous window. Null when no queue-landed merges.
---@field merge_queue_multi_attempt_merge_share number|distilled.Null Fraction (0-1) of queue-landed merges that needed more than one gate attempt. Null when no queue-landed merges.
---@field merge_queue_multi_attempt_merge_share_prev number|distilled.Null The same fraction over the previous window. Null when no queue-landed merges.
---@field merge_queue_failed_gate_merge_share number|distilled.Null Fraction (0-1) of queue-landed merges with at least one failed gate run before merging. Derived from CI run conclusions, not the queue's own eviction records. Null when no queue-landed merges.
---@field merge_queue_failed_gate_merge_share_prev number|distilled.Null The same fraction over the previous window. Null when no queue-landed merges.
---@field merge_queue_trunk_available boolean Whether the team's TrunkIo warehouse source has the opt-in merge-queue endpoint synced and readable by the requesting user. When false, every merge_queue_failed_or_cancelled_* and merge_queue_skip_the_line_* field is null; fall back to merge_queue_failed_gate_merge_share.
---@field merge_queue_failed_or_cancelled_share number|distilled.Null Fraction (0-1) of concluded queue entries (merged, failed, or cancelled) that ended failed or cancelled, from the queue's own records. Windowed on each entry's last state change. Null when the Trunk source isn't synced or nothing concluded.
---@field merge_queue_failed_or_cancelled_share_prev number|distilled.Null The same fraction over the previous window. Null when the Trunk source isn't synced or nothing concluded.
---@field merge_queue_skip_the_line_count number|distilled.Null Queue entries flagged skip-the-line (prioritized past the queue order) in the window, whatever state they reached. Null when the Trunk source isn't synced.
---@field merge_queue_skip_the_line_count_prev number|distilled.Null Skip-the-line entries over the previous window. Null when the Trunk source isn't synced.
---@field median_time_to_green_seconds number|distilled.Null Median wall clock for a PR push round to settle fully green over the window: the window-level twin of time_to_green_series, same population and exclusions. Null when no fully green rounds.
---@field median_time_to_green_seconds_prev number|distilled.Null The same median over the previous window. Null when no fully green rounds.
---@field jobs_available boolean Whether the job-level source is synced (cost and queue figures exist).
---@field default_branch string 'master' or 'main', picked by observed run volume in the window.
---@field cost_series_granularity string Bucket width of the cost_series trend, chosen to fit the window: 'hour', 'day', or 'week'.
---@field time_to_green_series_granularity string Bucket width of the time_to_green_series trend: 'hour', 'day', or 'week'.
---@field success_rate_series_granularity string Bucket width of the success_rate_series trend: 'hour', 'day', or 'week'.
---@field open_to_merge_series_granularity string Bucket width of the open_to_merge_series trend: 'hour', 'day', or 'week'.
---@field ready_to_merge_series_granularity string Bucket width of the ready_to_merge_series trend: 'hour', 'day', or 'week'.
---@field revert_share_series_granularity string Bucket width of the revert_share_series trend: 'hour', 'day', or 'week'.

---CI cost per merged PR across the window, oldest first, zero-filled, bucketed by cost_series_granularity. Empty when the job-level source isn't synced or include_series=false.
---@alias posthog.engineering_analytics.RepoOverviewCostSeriesList posthog.engineering_analytics.CostPerMergeBucket[]

---Median time-to-merge (p50 open_to_merge_seconds, bots/drafts excluded) per bucket across the window, oldest first, bucketed by open_to_merge_series_granularity. Empty buckets carry null; the whole series is empty when include_series=false.
---@alias posthog.engineering_analytics.RepoOverviewOpenToMergeSeriesList posthog.engineering_analytics.OpenToMergeBucket[]

---Median cycle time (p50 per-PR ready_to_merge_seconds, bots/drafts excluded) per bucket across the window, oldest first, bucketed by ready_to_merge_series_granularity. Empty buckets carry null; the whole series is empty when the issue-events table isn't synced or include_series=false, so fall back to open_to_merge_series.
---@alias posthog.engineering_analytics.RepoOverviewReadyToMergeSeriesList posthog.engineering_analytics.ReadyToMergeBucket[]

---Reverting merges over all merges (all authors, bots included) per bucket across the window, oldest first, zero-filled, bucketed by revert_share_series_granularity. Empty buckets carry a null share; the whole series is empty when include_series=false.
---@alias posthog.engineering_analytics.RepoOverviewRevertShareSeriesList posthog.engineering_analytics.RevertShareBucket[]

---CI pass rate (conclusive runs that succeeded, all branches) per bucket across the window, oldest first, bucketed by success_rate_series_granularity. Skipped, cancelled, neutral, and action_required runs are excluded. Empty buckets carry null; the whole series is empty when include_series=false.
---@alias posthog.engineering_analytics.RepoOverviewSuccessRateSeriesList posthog.engineering_analytics.PassRateBucket[]

---Median time-to-green (p50 wall clock for a PR push round to settle fully green) per bucket across the window, oldest first, bucketed by time_to_green_series_granularity. Empty buckets carry null; the whole series is empty when include_series=false.
---@alias posthog.engineering_analytics.RepoOverviewTimeToGreenSeriesList posthog.engineering_analytics.TimeToGreenBucket[]

