---@class posthog.engineering_analytics.RunEngineeringAnalyticsRepoActivityRequest
---@field project_id string Project ID of the project you're trying to access. To find the ID of the project, make a call to /api/projects/.
---@field branch? string Optional exact git branch (head_branch) to chart, e.g. 'main'. Omit or leave blank to use the repo's detected default branch.
---@field date_from? string Window start: relative ('-30d', '-8w') or ISO8601. Defaults to -30d.
---@field date_to? string Window end: relative or ISO8601. Defaults to now.
---@field repo? string 'owner/name' repository to scope to when the selected source syncs several repositories (from the `sources` list). Defaults to the source's first repository.
---@field source_id? string Connected GitHub data warehouse source to read from. Defaults to the oldest connected GitHub source that the `sources` list reports as synced, when the team has more than one.

---@class posthog.engineering_analytics.RunEngineeringAnalyticsWorkflowActivityRequest
---@field project_id string Project ID of the project you're trying to access. To find the ID of the project, make a call to /api/projects/.
---@field branch? string Optional exact git branch (head_branch) to scope results to, e.g. 'main'. Omit or leave blank to aggregate across all branches.
---@field date_from? string Window start: relative ('-30d', '-8w') or ISO8601. Defaults to -30d.
---@field date_to? string Window end: relative or ISO8601. Defaults to now.
---@field repo string 'owner/name' repository the workflow belongs to.
---@field run_scope? posthog.engineering_analytics.RunEngineeringAnalyticsWorkflowActivityRequestRunScope|string Which group of runs to report on: 'all' (default) is every run; 'default_branch' is runs on master or main; 'pull_request' is runs on PR branches, excluding default-branch and merge-queue runs; 'merge_queue' is the gate runs the merge queue fired before a merge landed. Fork PRs carry no PR attribution (a GitHub limitation), so they appear only under 'all'. Any other value is a 400.
---@field source_id? string Connected GitHub data warehouse source to read from. Defaults to the oldest connected GitHub source that the `sources` list reports as synced, when the team has more than one.
---@field workflow_name string Workflow name to load run activity for.

---@alias posthog.engineering_analytics.RunEngineeringAnalyticsWorkflowActivityRequestRunScope "all"|"default_branch"|"merge_queue"|"pull_request"

