---@class posthog.engineering_analytics.WorkflowHealthItem
---@field repo posthog.engineering_analytics.RepoRef Repository the workflow runs in.
---@field buckets posthog.engineering_analytics.WorkflowHealthItemBucketsList Run history across the whole window, oldest first, zero-filled, bucketed by granularity.
---@field workflow_name string GitHub Actions workflow name.
---@field run_count number Total runs started in the window.
---@field successful_run_count number Completed runs with conclusion 'success'.
---@field conclusive_run_count number Completed runs that succeeded or ended in failure, timeout, startup failure, or staleness. This is the success_rate denominator.
---@field success_rate number|distilled.Null Fraction of conclusive runs that succeeded (0-1). Failures include failure, timed_out, startup_failure, and stale. Skipped, cancelled, neutral, and action_required runs are excluded. Null if no run reached a verdict.
---@field p50_seconds number|distilled.Null Median duration in seconds over successful runs only: cancelled (superseded) and failed runs end early and would bias the percentile. Runs under 10 seconds that did no work are excluded when longer successful runs exist. An all-fast workflow uses every successful run. Null if no run succeeded in the window.
---@field p95_seconds number|distilled.Null 95th-percentile duration in seconds over successful runs only: cancelled (superseded) and failed runs end early and would bias the percentile. Runs under 10 seconds that did no work are excluded when longer successful runs exist. An all-fast workflow uses every successful run. Null if no run succeeded in the window.
---@field last_failure_at string|distilled.Null When the most recent decisive failure started, or null.
---@field latest_run_failed boolean|distilled.Null Whether the most recent completed run ended in failure, timeout, startup failure, or staleness. Null when no run has completed in the window. Powers the OK/RED status badge.
---@field latest_run_conclusion string|distilled.Null Raw conclusion of the most recent completed run ('success', 'cancelled', 'skipped', ...), so a real pass can be told from a non-failure non-success. Null when none completed.
---@field latest_run_id number|distilled.Null
---@field latest_run_attempt number|distilled.Null
---@field granularity string Bucket width of the `buckets` series, chosen to fit the window: 'hour', 'day', or 'week'.
---@field billable_minutes? number|distilled.Null Billable (self-hosted) minutes over this workflow's jobs in the window. Null when the job-level source isn't synced.
---@field estimated_cost_usd? number|distilled.Null Estimated cost in USD over this workflow's jobs in the window. Null when nothing was costable or the job source isn't synced.
---@field rerun_cycles? number Runs in the window that were a 2nd+ attempt - retry pressure, a flakiness proxy.
---@field success_rate_prev? number|distilled.Null Conclusive-run success rate over the equal-length window before date_from - the delta baseline. Null when that window had no conclusive runs.
---@field percentile_run_count? number Successful runs lasting at least 10 seconds. Zero when p50/p95 fall back to shorter successful runs.
---@field merge_queue_run_count? number Runs on merge-queue gate branches (trunk-merge/**) in the window, counted regardless of branch or run_scope. Non-zero marks a workflow the queue runs before a merge lands, the closest available proxy for a required check.
---@field latest_ci_engine? posthog.engineering_analytics.CIEngineEnum|distilled.Null CI execution engine; null when unknown. * `github_actions` - GitHub Actions * `depot_ci` - Depot CI

---Run history across the whole window, oldest first, zero-filled, bucketed by granularity.
