---@class posthog.engineering_analytics.WorkflowJobAggregate
---@field job_name string De-sharded job name: the matrix '(G/N)' suffix is stripped and unexpanded '${{ matrix.* }}' templates are collapsed, so shards of one matrix aggregate together.
---@field job_count number Job instances observed in the window (all shards, all attempts).
---@field shard_count number Distinct raw job names inside the group - the observed matrix width.
---@field runs_in number Distinct workflow runs the job appeared in.
---@field run_share number|distilled.Null runs_in divided by the workflow's total runs in the window; below 1.0 means the job is conditional and skips some runs. Null when the workflow had no runs.
---@field queue_p50_seconds number|distilled.Null Median queue wait (created to started) in seconds - where runner-capacity problems hide. Null when nothing started.
---@field p50_seconds number|distilled.Null Median duration of successful job instances, in seconds: cancelled and failed instances end early and would bias the percentile. Null if none succeeded.
---@field p95_seconds number|distilled.Null 95th-percentile duration of successful job instances, in seconds: cancelled and failed instances end early and would bias the percentile. Null if none succeeded.
---@field failure_rate number|distilled.Null Decisive failures over job instances with a pass-or-fail verdict (0-1). Skipped, cancelled, neutral, and action-required instances are excluded. Null if none reached a verdict.
---@field retry_job_count number Job instances that ran on a 2nd+ run attempt - retry pressure.
---@field billable_minutes number|distilled.Null Billable (self-hosted) minutes across the group's instances; null when every instance ran on an unknown tier.
---@field estimated_cost_usd number|distilled.Null Estimated cost in USD via the runner-tier rate ladder; null when every instance ran on an unknown tier.

